Mat2Doc — MATLAB port of python-docx
=====================================

This toolbox is a functional port of python-docx to MATLAB.

Upstream:
  Project:  python-docx
  Author:   Steve Canny
  URL:      https://github.com/python-openxml/python-docx
  Version:  1.2.0 (tag v1.2.0, commit e45454602b53e8e572b179ccf1c91093ec9f4ed7)
  License:  MIT

The default document template (templates/default.docx) and ported code
structure, API, and behavior derive from python-docx.
